{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は家でゆっくり休みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"掃除も終わってすっきりなの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンドルよいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癒されるね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな漫画って何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今友達から借りてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"となりの怪物くんハマってる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメも見てる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q＆Aリサイタル！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスケーキを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手づくりとかするん?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい頃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生クリームをホイップしてました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真のカードって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かに使ったりするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飾るつもりなのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう飾るとこないな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もんじゃ焼くの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手ですか（＾＾）？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きは上手そうなの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想像できるんですけどね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん。どうしてお好み焼きは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手そうなんだ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼いてるのを眺めてる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思ったら違うんだな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は焼く担当だったんだな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからほめられたんだな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっはっはっは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何もんじゃ好きー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もんじゃやお好み焼きで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に入れたい具ってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいろんな種類があって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなの食べたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりチーズがいちばん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古着屋行くのにいくらくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってくん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5000～10000円くらい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優柔不断で大金使うのが怖いから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局そんなに使わないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬休みの宿題とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつ終わらせる派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コツコツやっていくのが理想..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギリギリになるときもあるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意な教科ってなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかね、勉強してたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会すきだなーって思った..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意とかそういうんじゃなくてすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本史、世界史..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きな卵料理って何??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘い卵焼き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日撮影ある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/08/7010712/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ゔーーーー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"